aq:ChemicalEntity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:NonLivingEntity .
aq:WaterQualityParameter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalEntity .
aq:PhysicochemicalParameter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:WaterQualityParameter .
aq:HydrochemicalParameter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:WaterQualityParameter .
aq:pH a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:HydrochemicalParameter .
aq:OxygenContent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:HydrochemicalParameter .
