aq:Sulfate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:HydrochemicalParameter .
aq:Calcium a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:HydrochemicalParameter .
aq:CarbonDioxide a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:HydrochemicalParameter .
aq:OrganicMatter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalEntity .
aq:MobileOrganicMatter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:OrganicMatter .
aq:DissolvedOrganicMatter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:OrganicMatter .
aq:Peptide a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalEntity .
aq:ChemicalSignal a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalEntity .
aq:SurfaceChemicalSignal a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalSignal .
aq:SubsurfaceChemicalSignal a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalSignal .
aq:Colloid a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalEntity .
aq:Biocolloid a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Colloid .
aq:AquaticColloid a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Colloid .
aq:Substrate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ChemicalEntity .
aq:MineralSubstrate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Substrate .
aq:OrganicSubstrate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Substrate .
aq:CarbonateMineral a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:MineralSubstrate .

aq:GeologicalSetting a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:NonLivingEntity .
