aq:AnoxicZoneMicrobe a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Microbe .
aq:GroundwaterMicrobe a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Microbe .
aq:SoilMicrobe a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Microbe .
aq:AbovegroundMicrobe a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Microbe .
aq:SubsurfaceMicrobe a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Microbe .
aq:EukaryoticMicrobe a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Eukaryote .
aq:MicrobialFungus a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:AquaticFungus .
aq:HydrochemicalShift a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Process .
aq:GroundwaterQualityChange a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Process .
aq:RechargeVariation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:HydrologicalProcess .
aq:VulnerabilityAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Indicator .
aq:ProtectionMeasure a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Entity .
aq:ContaminationSource a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Entity .
aq:AgriculturalRunoff a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:ContaminationSource .
aq:SurfaceWater a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Habitat .
aq:MarineEnvironment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aq:Habitat .

### Competency Question Coverage Notes as comments
# CQ coverage supported by classes/properties above includes:
# microbial guild dominance, fungal and microbial occurrence, geochemical contributions,
# habitat distribution, aboveground vs subsurface comparison, hydrochemistry variation,
# pedological setting effects, karstification effects, colloid-microbe interactions,
# carbonate dissolution effects, eukaryotic species and interactions,
# mobile organic matter influence, groundwater supply factors,
# precipitation and snowmelt effects, agricultural impacts,
# environmental settings, strata continuity and infiltration, subsoil characteristics,
# mineral-organic interactions, DOC effects, heterotrophic-autotrophic interactions,
# flow and transport, temporal changes, physicochemical shaping,
# contamination, contaminant transport, substrates and metabolism,
# climate impacts, biodiversity and functioning, lithology/mineral composition, and indicator roles.